scrcode,DNF|Boats in race +|1|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|No|No|147||Started but did not finish,,
scrcode,DNS|Score like|DNF|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|No|No|No|147||Came to the start area but did not start,,
scrcode,DPI1|Fixed penalty|1|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|Yes|147||1 point discretionary penalty,,
scrcode,DSQ|Score like|DNF|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|No|147||Disqualification,,
scrcode,NSC|Score like|DNF|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|No|No|147||A boat did not sail the course as defined rule A5.1,,
scrcode,OCS|Score like|DNF|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|No|No|No|147||On course side at start or broke rule 30.1,,
scrcode,OOD|Average (all)||Yes|No|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|No|147||Race officer duty points scored as RDGa,,
scrcode,RDG|Set points by hand||Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|Yes|147||Redress - points set by protest hearing,,
scrcode,RDGa|Average (all)||Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|Yes|147||Redress - average points for all races except the race in question,,
scrcode,RDGb|Average (before)||Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|Yes|147||Redress - average points for all races preceding the race in question,,
scrcode,RET|Score like|DNF|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|No|No|147||Retired,,
scrcode,SCP|Percentage penalty DNF|20|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|Yes|147||Scoring penalty under rule 44.3,,
scrcode,UFD|Score like|DNF|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|No|No|No|147||U flag disqualification under rule 30.3,,
scrcode,ZFP|Percentage penalty DNF|20|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|Yes|147||20% penalty under rule 30.2,,
